; Entries you write by hand: opening balances, cash spending, assets you value yourself.
;
; Opening balances on the first day (one per account, from your statement):
; 2026-10-01 * "Opening balance"
;   Assets:Bank:Akbank            12345.67 TRY
;   Equity:Opening-Balances
;
; A balance check from a statement (Beancount stops you if the books disagree):
; 2026-10-31 balance Assets:Bank:Akbank   9876.54 TRY
;
; Cash spending:
; 2026-10-05 * "Pazar" "vegetables" #weekly-market
;   Expenses:Food:Groceries        350.00 TRY
;   Assets:Cash:Wallet
;
; An asset you value yourself (open it in accounts.beancount first), revalued with a
; balance-adjusting entry when its value changes:
; 2026-10-01 * "Home, own estimate"
;   Assets:Property:Home       5000000.00 TRY
;   Equity:Opening-Balances
